## 11. Improve Data Source resolution priority

Within the V3 resolution sequence, use:

```text
1. DIRECT_REFERENCE
2. fully qualified model reference
3. current local block
4. current parent/container member
5. current Library
6. current Library Input / Output / UDF
7. project-level Calculation / UDF
8. known Data Source or Data Set namespace
9. Data Source member resolution using NPZ schema
10. other Library OUTPUT only when explicitly allowed
11. unresolved
```

Never use an unrelated Library's internal field merely because the short name matches.

---

